assName\":\"w-full text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\",\"children\":\"Res\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"Score\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-2 font-medium\",\"children\":\"FPS\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"className\":\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\",\"children\":\"Power\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"720p\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\",\"children\":\"720p\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"4,912\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\",\"children\":\"195.0\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\",\"children\":\"43w\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"900p\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\",\"children\":\"900p\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"3,442\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\",\"children\":\"136.6\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\",\"children\":\"43w\"}]]}],\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\"]}]]}]]}],\"$L1e\"]}]]}]\n1f:T4ba,WINSIS WI-02 is a barebone workstation chassis similar to Dell, Lenovo or HP desktop towers with fairly weak airflow, making low-powered components essential for thermal control. Only one side access panel for working on the build. Supports one 2.5\" OR 3.5\" HDD and a laptop 12.4mm optical drive. Comes with a single 50mm x 10mm Molex-powered case fan for exhaust. Supports single-slot low-profile cards. The discrete RX6400 GPU had critical thermal issues (up to 96C) due to zero gap between card and PSU for air intake. This build would be much better as an APU-only system rather than attempting to fit a discrete GPU unless the TFX PSU is replaced with a Flex-ATX PSU. Performance is strong for workstation tasks and decent light gaming/e-sports. At full stress loads, temperatures settled in the low 80s C, within safe limits but not suitable for constant extended stress testing. Optional DVD drive supports movies, CD/DVD burning, and data archiving but lacks Blu-ray support. NOT recommended with any discrete graphics card due to airflow limitations. Better suited for low-powered contemporary components than upgrading legacy OEM workstations. Not suitable for high-performance processors like i7/i9.19:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\",\"children\":\"Builder notes\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\",\"children\":\"$1f\"}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Performance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\",\"children\":\"CPU — CB23 Multi\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"12,038\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"31%\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text